Cheaper inline-cache hints and inline number comparisons.

Hints become byte offsets in an array parallel to the code, found by
adding a fixed distance to the instruction address, so a hit needs no
index arithmetic or spilled locals.  OP_LT and OP_LE compare numbers
inline.  fastchain moves out of BRAM to make room.

